#eth  Support levels (from strong to weak)
First short-term support: $1885-$1890. This is the intraday heavy volume (choke) area; a retest here is a short-term long position defense line;

Strong support: $1855-$1870. The bottom of the recent week’s range; if broken, it will open up more downside space;

Extreme support: $1820. The key bottom for this pullback.
Resistance levels (from near to far)

First resistance: $1915-$1930. A point where price has repeatedly surged and then pulled back recently; it is the easiest area to face pressure;
Medium-term strong resistance: $1975-$1990. Pressure from the 50-day moving average; it is unlikely to break through effectively within the next 3 days;
Stage checkpoint: $2000. The psychological level.
Indicator status
RSI = 48, in a neutral-to-slightly-weak range;
Daily MACD is in a bearish alignment. On the 4-hour chart, there is a modest short-term bullish repair; the rebound is a repair after a decline, not a trend reversal. Selling pressure on rallies is heavy.
1️⃣ Final recommendation (short at the $1920 area 🈳). Take-profit at your own discretion and manage profits yourself. The live account is already open, and copy-trading is already available. This is only for reference as advice. One month: +300,000 (¥) in profit
